{"b":"Ps","c":38,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"O LORD, rebuke me not in thy wrath: neither chasten me in thy hot displeasure.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.6.1",7,"q"],["Heb.12.5",5,"r"],["Heb.12.11",5,"r"],["Isa.54.8",5,"w"],["Ps.70.1",4,"r"],["Jer.30.11",4,"r"],["Jer.10.24",3,"r"],["Isa.27.8",2,"r"],["Ps.88.15",2,"r"],["Ps.88.16",2,"w"]]},{"n":2,"t":"For thine arrows stick fast in me, and thy hand presseth me sore.","x":[["Job.6.4",5,"w"],["Ps.32.4",5,"r"],["Ps.64.7",2,"r"],["1Sam.5.11",2,"r"],["Ps.39.10",2,"r"],["Ps.39.11",2,"r"],["Deut.2.15",2,"r"],["Ruth.1.13",2,"r"],["Ps.21.12",2,"w"],["1Sam.5.6",2,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"There is no soundness in my flesh because of thine anger; neither is there any rest in my bones because of my sin.","it":[[0,8],[66,78]],"x":[["Ps.6.2",6,"w"],["Ps.51.8",4,"w"],["Isa.1.5",2,"r"],["Isa.1.6",2,"w"],["Ps.102.5",1,"w"],["Job.2.7",1,"r"],["Job.2.8",1,"r"],["Ps.31.9",1,"r"],["Ps.31.10",1,"w"],["Lam.3.40",1,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"For mine iniquities are gone over mine head: as an heavy burden they are too heavy for me.","x":[["Ps.40.12",11,"e"],["Ezra.9.6",9,"w"],["Matt.11.28",7,"w"],["Lam.1.14",4,"r"],["1Pet.2.24",4,"r"],["Lev.7.18",3,"r"],["Isa.53.11",3,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"My wounds stink and are corrupt because of my foolishness.","it":[[16,19]],"x":[["Isa.1.5",3,"r"],["Isa.1.6",3,"w"],["Jer.8.22",2,"r"],["Ps.69.5",2,"w"],["Ps.38.7",2,"r"],["Ps.32.3",2,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"I am troubled; I am bowed down greatly; I go mourning all the day long.","x":[["Job.30.28",6,"w"],["Ps.35.14",5,"w"],["Ps.42.9",4,"w"],["Ps.43.2",3,"w"],["Ps.42.5",3,"r"],["Ps.31.10",2,"r"],["Ps.57.6",2,"w"],["Ps.145.14",2,"w"],["Ps.88.9",2,"r"],["Ps.6.6",2,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"For my loins are filled with a loathsome disease: and there is no soundness in my flesh.","it":[[41,49],[54,62]],"x":[["Ps.41.8",2,"w"],["2Chr.21.18",2,"w"],["2Chr.21.19",2,"r"],["Ps.102.3",2,"r"],["Acts.12.23",2,"r"],["Job.7.5",2,"w"],["Job.30.18",1,"w"]]},{"n":8,"t":"I am feeble and sore broken: I have roared by reason of the disquietness of my heart.","x":[["Job.3.24",4,"r"],["Ps.32.3",4,"r"],["Job.30.28",3,"r"],["Isa.59.11",2,"w"],["Ps.22.1",1,"r"],["Ps.22.2",1,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"Lord, all my desire is before thee; and my groaning is not hid from thee.","it":[[20,22]],"x":[["Ps.10.17",7,"w"],["Ps.6.6",6,"w"],["2Cor.5.2",5,"r"],["John.1.48",5,"r"],["Ps.102.5",4,"w"],["Rom.8.26",3,"r"],["Rom.8.27",3,"r"],["Rom.8.22",2,"r"],["Rom.8.23",2,"r"],["Ps.102.20",1,"w"]]},{"n":10,"t":"My heart panteth, my strength faileth me: as for the light of mine eyes, it also is gone from me.","x":[["Ps.6.7",6,"r"],["Ps.88.9",4,"r"],["Ps.69.3",4,"r"],["Ps.143.4",2,"r"],["Ps.143.7",2,"w"],["Lam.5.16",2,"r"],["Lam.5.17",2,"r"],["Ps.119.123",2,"r"],["1Sam.14.27",2,"r"],["1Sam.14.29",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"My lovers and my friends stand aloof from my sore; and my kinsmen stand afar off.","x":[["Ps.31.11",7,"r"],["Luke.23.49",6,"w"],["Job.19.13",5,"r"],["Job.19.17",5,"r"],["Luke.10.31",4,"r"],["Luke.10.32",4,"r"],["Ps.88.18",4,"r"],["John.16.32",3,"r"],["Job.6.21",3,"r"],["Job.6.23",3,"r"]]},{"n":12,"t":"They also that seek after my life lay snares for me: and they that seek my hurt speak mischievous things, and imagine deceits all the day long.","it":[[45,52]],"x":[["Ps.35.20",5,"r"],["2Sam.17.1",4,"r"],["2Sam.17.3",4,"r"],["Ps.140.5",4,"r"],["2Sam.16.7",3,"r"],["2Sam.16.8",3,"r"],["Ps.141.9",3,"w"],["Ps.35.4",3,"w"],["Ps.64.2",3,"r"],["Ps.64.5",3,"w"]]},{"n":13,"t":"But I, as a deaf man, heard not; and I was as a dumb man that openeth not his mouth.","it":[[17,21],[37,42],[57,61]],"x":[["Ps.39.9",4,"w"],["Isa.53.7",4,"e"],["Ps.39.2",4,"w"],["1Pet.2.23",3,"r"],["2Sam.16.10",2,"r"],["2Sam.16.12",2,"r"]]},{"n":14,"t":"Thus I was as a man that heareth not, and in whose mouth are no reproofs.","it":[[57,60]],"x":[["John.8.6",3,"r"],["Mark.15.3",3,"r"],["Mark.15.5",3,"r"],["Amos.5.13",3,"r"],["Mic.7.5",2,"w"]]},{"n":15,"t":"For in thee, O LORD, do I hope: thou wilt hear, O Lord my God.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.39.7",9,"w"],["Ps.17.6",8,"r"],["Ps.138.3",4,"r"],["Ps.123.1",3,"r"],["Ps.123.3",3,"r"]]},{"n":16,"t":"For I said, Hear me, lest otherwise they should rejoice over me: when my foot slippeth, they magnify themselves against me.","it":[[12,20],[26,35],[101,111]],"x":[["Ps.94.18",4,"w"],["Deut.32.35",3,"w"],["Ps.13.3",3,"r"],["Ps.13.4",3,"w"],["Ps.35.24",3,"w"],["Ps.35.26",3,"e"]]},{"n":17,"t":"For I am ready to halt, and my sorrow is continually before me.","it":[[6,8],[38,40]],"x":[["Ps.35.15",7,"r"],["Ps.38.6",6,"r"],["Ps.6.6",5,"r"],["Isa.53.3",5,"r"],["Isa.53.5",5,"r"],["Mic.4.6",5,"r"],["Mic.4.7",5,"r"],["Ps.77.2",5,"r"],["Ps.77.3",5,"r"]]},{"n":18,"t":"For I will declare mine iniquity; I will be sorry for my sin.","x":[["Ps.32.5",8,"e"],["Prov.28.13",8,"r"],["Ps.51.3",5,"w"],["Job.33.27",4,"r"],["2Cor.7.7",3,"r"],["2Cor.7.11",3,"r"],["Job.31.33",2,"w"]]},{"n":19,"t":"But mine enemies are lively, and they are strong: and they that hate me wrongfully are multiplied.","it":[[17,20],[29,32]],"x":[["Ps.35.19",5,"e"],["Matt.10.22",2,"r"],["Ps.59.1",2,"w"],["Ps.59.3",2,"r"],["Ps.3.1",2,"r"],["John.15.18",2,"w"],["John.15.25",2,"r"],["Ps.18.17",2,"w"],["Acts.4.25",2,"r"],["Acts.4.28",2,"r"]]},{"n":20,"t":"They also that render evil for good are mine adversaries; because I follow the thing that good is.","it":[[75,89],[95,98]],"x":[["Ps.35.12",7,"r"],["1John.3.12",6,"r"],["Jer.18.20",4,"r"],["1Pet.4.14",3,"r"],["1Pet.4.16",3,"r"],["Ps.7.4",3,"r"],["1Sam.23.12",3,"r"],["1Sam.19.4",3,"r"],["1Sam.19.6",3,"r"],["Ps.109.3",3,"r"]]},{"n":21,"t":"Forsake me not, O LORD: O my God, be not far from me.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.22.19",7,"w"],["Ps.22.24",6,"r"],["Ps.22.11",4,"w"],["Ps.35.21",3,"r"],["Ps.35.22",3,"w"],["Ps.22.1",2,"w"]]},{"n":22,"t":"Make haste to help me, O Lord my salvation.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O Lord”."},"x":[["Ps.27.1",10,"w"],["Ps.40.13",10,"w"],["Isa.12.2",6,"w"],["Ps.70.5",5,"e"],["Ps.40.17",5,"w"],["Ps.71.12",5,"w"],["Ps.62.6",5,"w"],["Ps.70.1",4,"e"],["Ps.62.2",4,"w"],["Ps.141.1",4,"w"]]}],"title":"A Psalm of David, to bring to remembrance."}